  test vectors, "SigVer" (CAVS 11.0).
  Source: https://csrc.nist.gov/CSRC/media/Projects/Cryptographic-Algorithm-Validation-Program/documents/dss/186-4ecdsatestvectors.zip
          (member 186-4ecdsatestvectors/SigVer.rsp)
